se ship reaches the floor of the band on a ballistic arc with 29.5% of its tank left and a 97-second EVA window (measured). It can technically circularise at the floor, but arrives with 0% left and nothing to deorbit on — so the arc is the first launch's route\\\"\",\n          \"cites\": [\"2.5d\", \"2.6a\"],\n          \"why\": \"The passage is explicit that the base ship does have the fuel to circularise at the floor — what it does not have is anything left to deorbit on. The line replaces the real reason with a fuel shortfall the document denies.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"corrected\": {\n        \"line\": \"Arc it, kid. Circularising is the rest of your tank — you'd get up there with nothing left to bring her back down.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"climb_heat_first\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"staged\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"commit_floor_blocked\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"skim_complete\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"first_plasma\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"chute_green\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"shield_spent\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"hold_mass_amber\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"hold_mass_red\",\n      \"verdict\": \"revise\",\n      \"issues\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"contradicts_gdd\",\n          \"quote\": \"let something go, right hand button, and it drifts off clean\",\n          \"evidence\": \"[2.4a] \\\"Stow at the hold (E) to bank it. The greed decision: every trip out costs jetpack fuel and every stowed piece is permanent mass for the ride down.\\\" [2.4b] \\\"The greed decision is informed but never reversible in flight.\\\"\",\n          \"cites\": [\"2.4a\", \"2.4b\"],\n          \"why\": \"The dial crosses into red at a stow, so the mass that tripped it is already banked. Release (RMB) acts on the tethered piece, not on the hold — telling the player to shed mass now offers an undo the passages say does not exist.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"corrected\": {\n        \"line\": \"Red on the scale, kid. What's banked is banked, and that ride down is destructive — the next piece you get on the tether, right hand button, let it drift.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"return_lamp_red\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"tow_fee_charged\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"hard_landing\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"module_tethered\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"module_degraded\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"burned_up\",\n      \"verdict\": \"revise\",\n      \"issues\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"contradicts_gdd\",\n          \"quote\": \"your haul's the only thing that's gone\",\n          \"evidence\": \"[1b] \\\"Every loss resets the current run: the ship respawns on the pad, cash and upgrades persist, and only this run's haul and its turnaround cost are lost\\\"\",\n          \"cites\": [\"1b\"],\n          \"why\": \"The document names two costs on a loss, the haul and the turnaround. Calling the haul the only loss understates the bill, and the bill is the register this game teaches failure in.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"corrected\": {\n        \"line\": \"Suit was never rated for that, kid. She's back on the pad — you're out the haul and the cost of turning her around, and nothing past that.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ending_pristine\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ending_refused\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issues\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}","ttft_ms":64358,"ttft_stream_ms":1208,"time_to_request_ms":301,"type":"result","duration_ms":79020,"uuid":"907bafea-852e-4b09-aaf4-2b94a3c10674"}
